CHAPTER.VERS:
Or are you

          {+}
         ignorant, brothers (for I speak to men who know the law), that the law has dominion over a man for as long as he lives?

Therefore, my brothers, you

          {+}
         also were made dead to the law through the body of Christ; that you

          {+}
         should be joined to another, to him who was raised from the dead, that we might bring forth fruit to God.
